From be610f0795939e047ad1eb2bc03c5009ba312e4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 13:30:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 109/140] Refactor Media Playback Notification and Skip Marker
 Logic

- Updated MediaPlaybackService to utilize NotificationCompat.ProgressStyle for progress notifications, enhancing the visual representation of playback progress.
- Removed the custom notification layout and replaced it with a more streamlined approach using built-in notification styles.
- Improved the handling of intro segment lookups in PlayerViewModel, introducing a generation mechanism to prevent outdated lookups.
- Enhanced SkipMarkerResolver to simplify segment validation and merging logic, ensuring more accurate skip markers.
- Updated various string resources across multiple languages to reflect the addition of SkipDB as a marker provider option.
